Implement user story SKY-004-B: Add build/start scripts and integration tests for Express server

## Story Description
Add 'start' and 'build' scripts to package.json. Install supertest and @types/supertest. Create src/server.test.ts using vitest + supertest with 8+ tests covering all endpoints, validation, error scenarios, and RAPIDAPI_KEY gating — with no real outbound HTTP calls. Depends on SKY-004-A.

## Acceptance Criteria
- package.json: 'start' → 'node dist/server.js'; 'build' produces dist/server.js and copies src/public/ to dist/public/
- supertest + @types/supertest in devDependencies; src/server.test.ts uses vitest + supertest; no real outbound HTTP calls during test execution; tsc --noEmit exits 0; vitest run exits 0
- Tests cover at least 8 cases: /health 200, / 200 HTML content, / 500 when index.html missing, /search 200 with valid params, /search 400 with missing/empty/invalid params, /cheapest 200 and 404, RAPIDAPI_KEY absent → 503, SkyscannerClient error → 500





